# The Baptist Standard Bearer, foreword (dated 20 October 1984) to its edition of Gill's Body of Divinity (docs/sources/lee-bsb.md).
# Status (ruling of 2026-11-22, docs/handoff/RULING_bsb_foreword_status_2026-11-22.md): published 1984; no copyright notice per Chris; publisher's stated position that its books are freely distributable; written confirmation to be sought before public launch.
# Cited by page. Short quotations of its numbered propositions are allowed in docs and consoles; none is stored here. No Body, Holding, Argument or gc:quotation here.

<source/bsb-gill-1984> a gc:SourceWork ;
    rdfs:label "The Baptist Standard Bearer, foreword to Gill's Body of Divinity (1984)"@en ;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "The Baptist Standard Bearer edition of Gill's Body of Divinity; foreword dated 20 October 1984. Status: published 1984; no copyright notice per Chris; publisher's stated position that its books are freely distributable; written confirmation to be sought before public launch." .

# Foreword pp. vii-viii, propositions 1 and 7 (ruling B-Q4). Nothing links to it yet; source/plumb-line/validity-3 will link by rdfs:seeAlso when the sitting writes it.
<source/bsb-gill-1984/foreword/vii-viii> a gc:SourceDivision ;
    rdfs:label "BSB foreword, pp. vii-viii, propositions 1 and 7"@en ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <source/bsb-gill-1984> .
